{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "title",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": -260,
   "width": 1500,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "# Which rules each assistant reads\nClaude and ChatGPT/Codex share one master rules file, and each also reads its own settings. A Codex-only rule in the workspace AGENTS.md was also being read by Claude, so Claude showed a Codex usage line. That section is now marked Codex only."
  },
  {
   "id": "shared",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### 📄 Shared rules\n`Shared\\ASSISTANT-RULES.md`\n- Master copy for both assistants\n- Usage line: Claude uses get_usage, ChatGPT its own readout"
  },
  {
   "id": "claudemd",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 240,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### 📄 Claude global\n`~\\.claude\\CLAUDE.md`\n- Only points at the shared rules"
  },
  {
   "id": "codexmd",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 480,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### 📄 Codex global\n`~\\.codex\\AGENTS.md`\n- Points at the shared rules\n- Codex's own working rules"
  },
  {
   "id": "agents",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 720,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### 📄 Workspace AGENTS.md\n`C:\\AI Workspace\\AGENTS.md`\n- Read by both when opened in that folder\n- Codex usage footer: now marked Codex only"
  },
  {
   "id": "claude",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 120,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "4",
   "text": "### 🤖 Claude\n*Code tab · Opus / Sonnet*\n- Reads: Claude global → Shared rules\n- Reads: workspace AGENTS.md\n- Plus: its own memory folder\n- Skips: the Codex footer section"
  },
  {
   "id": "codex",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 540,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 250,
   "color": "4",
   "text": "### 🤖 ChatGPT / Codex\n*Codex agent*\n- Reads: Codex global → Shared rules\n- Reads: workspace AGENTS.md\n- Uses: the Codex footer section"
  },
  {
   "id": "cl-usage",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1120,
   "y": 0,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### 📊 Claude usage line\n*end of each reply*\n- Format: Claude 5h % · Week % · reset times\n- From get_usage (also feeds the usage widget)"
  },
  {
   "id": "cx-usage",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1120,
   "y": 300,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### 📊 Codex usage line\n*end of each reply*\n- Format: Codex 5h % · Week % · reset times\n- From get_usage_limits"
  },
  {
   "id": "worklog",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1120,
   "y": 600,
   "width": 380,
   "height": 190,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### 📒 Work logs\n*Shared\\Worklog*\n- Each assistant logs what it did\n- Read the other's newest entries first"
  },
  {
   "id": "fixed",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 1000,
   "width": 940,
   "height": 170,
   "color": "4",
   "text": "### ✅ Fixed 30 Sep 2026\nClaude was following the Codex footer rule in the workspace AGENTS.md. That section now says Codex only, and Claude shows only its own usage. A cleaner option: move the Codex footer into Codex's own global file."
  }
 ],
